msgctxt "252"
msgid "Hey."
msgstr "Ehi."

msgctxt "264"
msgid "Hm? Oh, hey. You're Kazuma Kiryu, aren't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid "How did you know my name?"
msgstr "Eh? Come sai il mio nome?"

msgctxt "288"
msgid ""
"You're famous! Everybody knows you around here! Fifty\r\n"
"undefeated street battles! You have quite the reputation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid "But who are you?"
msgstr "Puoi dirmi chi sei?"

msgctxt "312"
msgid ""
"Bruce Ebinuma. We fought at the Underground Coliseum,\r\n"
"remember?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid "Oh, that Kenpo guy in the yellow gi..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid "Yeah. That's me."
msgstr "Sì, sono io."

msgctxt "348"
msgid "What are you doing here?"
msgstr "Che ci fai qui?"

msgctxt "360"
msgid "Looking for somebody."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid "That so?"
msgstr "Ah sì?"

msgctxt "384"
msgid "Yeah. Luckily, I just found him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid "Wait, you were looking for me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid ""
"Well, not <Italic>you</Italic>, exactly. I was just looking for somebody "
"strong."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "420"
msgid "What for?"
msgstr "E per cosa?"

msgctxt "432"
msgid ""
"The Underground Coliseum. I need somebody to enter the\r\n"
"Tag Match Grand Prix there with me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "444"
msgid "Why're you so interested in the Tag Match Grand Prix?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "456"
msgid ""
"I lost there once. Before entering that thing, I was\r\n"
"undefeated. I got cocky and thought I could pull off a tag\r\n"
"match on my strength alone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "468"
msgid ""
"So I paid some punk from Kamurocho to enter with me, but\r\n"
"we ended up losing..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "480"
msgid ""
"It taught me that, for tag matches, you need <Italic>two</Italic> good\r\n"
"fighters. One is just not enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid "So that's why you've been looking for somebody strong?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504"
msgid ""
"That's right. Just once, I want to experience the joy of\r\n"
"victory there alongside a good partner!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "516"
msgid "I see."
msgstr "Capisco."

msgctxt "528"
msgid ""
"Kazuma Kiryu, you're a great fighter, undefeated in fifty\r\n"
"street battles... You even beat me at the Underground Coliseum."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "540"
msgid "Please! You gotta enter that tag match with me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "552"
msgid "(Hmm. This guy might make a good tag match partner...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "564"
msgid "Sure."
msgstr "Certo."

msgctxt "576"
msgid "Really!?"
msgstr "Davvero!?"

msgctxt "588"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "600"
msgid ""
"Thank you so much! I'm going to fight my heart out, so\r\n"
"we can experience the joy of victory together!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "612"
msgid "Sounds good."
msgstr "Mi sembra una buona idea."

msgctxt "624"
msgid ""
"I'll go and register us at the Underground Coliseum right\r\n"
"away! I'll make it so you can just come and fight whenever\r\n"
"you want!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "636"
msgid "Got it."
msgstr "Capito."

msgctxt "648"
msgid "All right. See you at the Underground Coliseum!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "720"
msgid "No."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "732"
msgid "Why not?"
msgstr "Perché no?"

msgctxt "744"
msgid ""
"I have things to do. I don't have time to just hang around\r\n"
"with you all day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "756"
msgid ""
"Well, whenever it's convenient, then! I'll be ready anytime.\r\n"
"Just come by whenever you feel like it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "768"
msgid "Come on. Give it another thought?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "780"
msgid "What the hell. Fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "792"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr "Davvero?"

msgctxt "804"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "816"
msgid ""
"Thank you so much! I'm going to fight my heart out, so\r\n"
"we can experience the joy of victory together!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "828"
msgid "Sounds good."
msgstr "Mi sembra una buona idea."

msgctxt "840"
msgid ""
"I'll go and register us at the Underground Coliseum right\r\n"
"away! I'll make it so you can just come and fight whenever\r\n"
"you want!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "852"
msgid "Got it."
msgstr "Capito."

msgctxt "864"
msgid "All right. See you at the Underground Coliseum!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "936"
msgid ""
"I'm looking for a guy who's <Color:7>undefeated in over fifty street\r\n"
"battles<Color:Default>. Sorry. I don't have time to talk to you right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "948"
msgid "Hey, haven't we met before?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "960"
msgid ""
"What? I'm busy right now. I'm looking for somebody⑬\r\n"
"somebody really strong."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "972"
msgid "Someone strong? For a job or something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "984"
msgid ""
"Kinda. I'm looking for someone like the man I was talking\r\n"
"to. A guy who's <Color:7>undefeated in over fifty street battles<Color:Default>.\r\n"
"That's the kind of guy I want."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "996"
msgid "<Color:7>Undefeated in over fifty street battles<Color:Default>?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1008"
msgid ""
"Yeah, but from what I can tell, you're not quite at that\r\n"
"level yet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1020"
msgid "Sorry. I don't have time to talk to you right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1032"
msgid "Okay, then."
msgstr "Ok, allora."

msgctxt "1044"
msgid "Sure."
msgstr "Certo."

msgctxt "1056"
msgid "No."
msgstr ""

